{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>May Elohim enlarge Japheth.</b> Targum renders יַפְתֵּי — 'will enlarge.'" "<b>And may He dwell in the tents of Shem.</b> May His Shekhinah rest in Israel. And the midrash of the Sages: even though 'may Elohim enlarge Japheth' — Cyrus, who was of the descendants of Japheth, built the Second Temple — the Shekhinah did not rest in it. And where did it rest? In the First Temple, which Solomon, who was of the descendants of Shem, built." "<b>And Canaan shall be a servant to them.</b> Even when the descendants of Shem were exiled, they would buy slaves for themselves from the descendants of Canaan."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:12.107551147Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}